ATH_0012>? To get it we have to\napply the identifications above to <MATH_0013>.\nClearly under the identifications above this gives\nthat\n<MATH_0014>\nas expected.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:685a2945412bb46af6ecc65a8a3f451f746fa34cfce9aef81349375d8c94760e", "unit_id": "inventory:schemes:01JH:example/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:4c274a2db946cc48c29bc786240a502bb88bf136e8c2fcb1f2d2fc69f1eb61ba", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p1-29-morphisms-d032.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:16607cfe6c1a9646b9704ca97bd7098ae7db1a7de6a025a591c1c68c1676eb62", "path": "docs/evidence/p1-29-morphisms-d032-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:905e2176f25d981955825b8663c669bf6fd06efa6b6a94e58c69ccd54c3ea205"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:b753f6444727f8fc4aa34d05b8523e6abff18b21", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p1-29-morphisms-d032", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a21dde-a3f9-7993-a91a-698abd19d840", "unit_id": "tag:01RV:proof"}, "context_hash": "sha256:210274acc7a2c9c661eae29aad6d63f4c8c8a8b26125e96154144028f6573420", "created_at": "2026-11-27T16:37:41.235Z", "glossary_revision": "git:b753f6444727f8fc4aa34d05b8523e6abff18b21", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.172.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.2-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.2-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.2-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p1-29-morphisms-d032", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "p1-29-morphisms-d032", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c7250da9b958831a8c4ea129efa0744e524ff464beca04ec3f715a27351173c3", "